{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "SQL approval rules route requests to designated staff. But does a database ownership change require updating the approvers inside each rule?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I created a Connection Owner-based rule, processed one request, changed only the database owner, and checked who received the next request under the same rule."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Using the Connection Owner as Approver"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I named the rule "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "EP39 - Connection Owner Approval"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", selected SQL Request, and chose approval method "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Assign Connection Owner"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". Demo Developer remained executor and self-approval was disabled."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/approval-rules/01.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 1. Connection owner approves; Demo Developer executes.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 1. Connection owner approves; Demo Developer executes."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I registered the lab connection as "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Owner Handoff Lab"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", initially assigning Demo Approver as its sole Connection Owner."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/approval-rules/02.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 2. Demo Approver is the first owner of this database connection.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 2. Demo Approver is the first owner of this database connection."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Connection Owner is assigned per database connection, distinct from the organization-wide Owner role. Here it determines request approval routing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Developer had Read-Only on the new connection. I chose a SELECT for order 27002 that this access permits."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Approver Handles the First Request"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The developer submitted request A using the rule, Owner Handoff Lab, and the order SELECT. A marked it as before the handoff."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The form’s approver field showed "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Connection Owner"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". Submitted details resolved the actual approver to "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Demo Approver"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", without manually selecting a person."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/approval-rules/03.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 3. First submitted request assigned to Demo Approver.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 3. First submitted request assigned to Demo Approver."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Approver reviewed the connection and SQL and commented, ‘As connection owner, I reviewed and approve this fictional order query.’"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Developer then executed it. Results showed "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "1 Rows selected, in 4 ms"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", completing both approval and execution."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/approval-rules/04.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 4. First owner approves; developer completes execution.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 4. First owner approves; developer completes execution."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Changing Only the Owner, Keeping the Rule"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After A completed, I removed Demo Approver from Owner Handoff Lab’s owner list and selected "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Demo Auditor alone"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", then saved."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/approval-rules/05.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 5. The same connection’s owner changes to Demo Auditor.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 5. The same connection’s owner changes to Demo Auditor."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Connection details and developer Read-Only stayed unchanged. The rule retained Assign Connection Owner and executor Demo Developer. Only ownership changed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Next Request Goes to the New Owner"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Request B used exactly the same rule, connection, and SQL as A."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The form again showed Connection Owner, but submitted details assigned "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Demo Auditor"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ", reflecting the updated connection ownership."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/approval-rules/06.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 6. New request under the same rule assigned to Demo Auditor.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 6. New request under the same rule assigned to Demo Auditor."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Auditor reviewed B and approved with ‘As the new connection owner, I reviewed and approve this fictional order query.’"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/approval-rules/07.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 7. B is Approved in the new owner’s received requests.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 7. B is Approved in the new owner’s received requests."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Demo Developer executed B too; Results showed "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "1 Rows selected, in 3 ms"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". The unchanged rule handled the full process after the handoff."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Recording Who Processed Both Requests"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Workflow Logs found six events: submission, approval, execution for A and B. Demo Approver approved A, Demo Auditor B; Demo Developer submitted/executed both."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/approval-rules/08.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 8. Actual approvers differ across the two workflow histories.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 8. Actual approvers differ across the two workflow histories."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Query Audit showed both SELECTs succeeded via SQL Request on Owner Handoff Lab. Final inspection confirmed rule method, executor, and modified time had not changed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ownership changes did not require editing the rule’s names. New requests followed updated per-connection ownership while the approval model stayed fixed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This lab used QueryPie Community 11.6.7 and MySQL 8.0.42 with fictional users and orders."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
